# Companion material for sting.obj.
# The OBJ's own mtllib points at a file that doesn't ship, so the runtime's
# sibling-<basename>.mtl resolver looks for this file. Material name matches
# the OBJ's `usemtl Sting`; map_Kd links the diffuse texture that ships beside it.
newmtl Sting
Ka 1.000000 1.000000 1.000000
Kd 0.800000 0.800000 0.800000
illum 1
map_Kd sting-diffuse.png
